Subject: [PATCH] add vendor kernel patches (devices/google-aurora)

Add the vendor kernel patches and kernel derivation for the Google Pixel
Watch 2 (aurora), including continuous splash framebuffer support, EUD
secure-fail handling, RTC read-only handling, response-file fixes, and
the module file-function command.

The kernel patches are kept separate from the device configuration.
